  "_doc": "Study cards (Derek, 2026-10-18 on #6921, revised 18:38): the reference image is the clearest Dresden crop of the sign (never a held-out item); the sentence says only what is visible, plus a meaning from the colonial dictionaries (page cited) where the dictionary word is the day name itself. Landa appears only as a framed history note. No Morley.",
